{"server":"tw","storyId":"act7mini_level_act7mini_st05","groupId":"act7mini","stageId":null,"title":"異類","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act7mini/level_act7mini_st05.txt","sourceHash":"f1a8225c3ba94b5f2a61178878bce340c3e7d599ee71de3ebf0349c43ef8b43b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"離開當地貴族府邸的卡涅利安偶然發現感染者少女正遭受追捕，瞭解原因後，她向想要逃亡的感染者伸出援手。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"請您在此稍作等待，相關合約稍後將有專人送上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"關於這次合作的相關細節都整理在這裡了，還請您帶回，令伯爵大人過目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您還有任何問題，隨時可以向在下提出......卡涅利安小姐？您在聽嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......抱歉，一時有點恍神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼關於這次的合作，請問，您還有任何疑問嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時沒什麼問題，我會帶給霍恩洛厄大人，一切都將由伯爵本人定奪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"這太好了。相信伯爵大人會做出令我們雙方受益的決斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"您接下來便要回程了？若沒有什麼其他安排，費爾巴哈大人命我送您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送就不必了，還請替我向爵士轉達感激之情，感謝他的慷慨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難得來一趟，之後我還會在城裡逛逛，參觀一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那麼需要為您派一位嚮導嗎？我這就吩咐下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不勞您費心。我自己隨意轉轉就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......說起來，前一次合作時也是由我代表伯爵前來拜訪，那還是上一回女皇們宮廷設宴之前吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"正是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記得那時這裡還擺滿了異族的犄角作為裝飾，現在是換了另一種風格？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，比如這件台座擺飾，像這樣的質地和光澤可不是常見的貨色，我猜猜，莫非這些都是固化源石結晶的精製品？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"您猜的不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"卡涅利安小姐，不得不說，您比之前要更有眼光了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......過獎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"據我所知，這一類穩定的結晶，基本只在源石礦脈深處才能挖掘出，而且多半被包裹在源石內部，可以說是有價無市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且這種結晶，比岩石還要堅硬得多，一般的雕刻工藝可奈何不了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算上加工的難度，想要拿出這麼多工藝如此精美的裝飾品，費爾巴哈爵士一定也費了不少功夫吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有您說的那樣困難。費爾巴哈大人前陣子勤勉地巡視治下的土地，無意中發現了這些脫胎自源石深處的珍藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"大人認為，這種黑色的光澤富有意趣且別有一些隱意，十分適合觀賞，因此便下令將之裝飾在這裡，好讓前來拜訪的客人也能一同賞玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣看來，我們很該為爵士的慷慨舉杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"卡涅利安小姐，您好像對此很有瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞭解稱不上，只是......唔，我曾見過一次這東西的出產過程，個人確實對此有些感慨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看，這麼一小塊固化結晶，想要採掘往往得深入地下百米、千米，一不小心便會失足落下，屍骨無存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽聞，近期貴領礦區也出了不少事故？這東西啊，就這麼一小塊，上面凝結的鮮血，說不定就能填滿爵士的浴池呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"卡涅利安小姐，我想您或許還不太明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"在他人看來，這些東西也許確實難得，但於費爾巴哈大人，不過就只是一季的裝飾罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"費爾巴哈大人不必考慮您說的那些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"大人想要什麼，只是一句吩咐的事。我們這些人，便是為此才站在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，卡涅利安小姐有不同見解？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下恐怕不會想聽我的見解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......恕我直言。您蒙受了伯爵大人天大的恩情，卡涅利安小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"兩年前，當得知尚未成年的霍恩洛厄伯爵大人身邊，突然多出一個身世未知的外鄉人時，大家都對此感到吃驚，這可是從來沒有過的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"您本應當多顧及伯爵大人的立場及顏面，更加謹慎地行事才是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的口氣聽起來像是對我很不滿意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請別急著否認，實際上，我見識過不少對我懷有敵意的人，將伯爵也視作貴族中的異類的也大有人在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何，我說對了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......要整個萊塔尼亞接納一個外族人，並不是一件容易的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"但您並不在意那些流言，不是嗎。您有相應的才能，也有膽氣，我的言語只會是對您的讚譽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，狡猾的回答。不過，我姑且就當做誇獎收下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"至於您方才提到的，礦區的事故......這也無需擔憂，衛隊和術師團已經有所行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"您說的不錯，現在這樣的情況下，我們確實需要更加小心。這件事會被妥善處理，不會成為任何人攻擊侯爵大人的把柄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來閣下認為我是在為此擔憂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，就當做是這樣。不過，按照我的瞭解，你們的處理方式或許不怎麼和平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"只是撢去絨毯上的灰塵罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，您想說解決掉所有與此相關的人，也算是解決問題的一種方法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，看來我已經說得太多了。是時候告辭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"容我提醒您，爵士大可以不在意他那些染病的領民，但女皇們可不是什麼溫和的小羊羔，輕視她們不會有什麼好下場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不，不不，這您就錯了，卡涅利安小姐。我們從沒有輕視過女皇們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"女皇們需要權柄，需要更強、更有力的統治，她們要的不僅僅是追隨，而是服從。她們已經騰出空來，將目光轉向了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很明白。任何統治者，或許都無可避免會走向這個方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"這不令人驚訝，我們互相悉知彼此的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下看起來很有把握。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"您會這樣惶恐，是因為您沒有經歷過萊塔尼亞的曾經，卡涅利安小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"女皇們，不管是金色的，還是更令人畏懼的黑色的那一位，都難與曾籠罩在萊塔尼亞上方的陰影並論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管那陰影已被她們親手推翻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說的是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我見過那一個時代，高塔之上高懸的紅色水晶是父母用來讓他們的孩子變乖巧最好的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......巫王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我們很少提起這個名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也的確不常聽人提起。只有一些零散的傳聞，說起夜幕中的紅光，照亮天空，整個萊塔尼亞都看得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年長些的人似乎到現在也忘不掉那時候的事，但又對此噤若寒蟬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......這很正常。會讓人閉口不言的，除了信服，還有恐懼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我也曾見過那樣滿目的紅色......等到第二天，人們發現隔壁小鎮寂靜無聲，沒剩下一個活人，羽獸全都掉在地上，折斷了腳爪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人知道是為了什麼。只有紅光，和殘留下的滿地乾癟的屍首。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這聽起來像是恐怖故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜，這不只是個故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有原因，沒有規律，沒有解釋。沒有人敢多議論哪怕一句。萊塔尼亞曾生活在那樣一個時代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"女皇們的治下當然也並不寬鬆，但至少我們知道該如何應對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，我們敢於在舞會上體面地相互問好，而非在空懸的王座下噤若寒蟬，提心吊膽地擔憂厄運會不講道理、悄無聲息地落在自己頭上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這很難想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有親眼見過，確實會很難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"過去已經不再被提起，而現在......是我們大有可為的時代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大有可為......嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許閣下說的對。我們確實有許多可做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就預祝我們的合作順利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不打擾了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是那個風信子伯爵的異人侍從......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"主人的性情古怪，侍從更是粗俗又大膽，果然和傳聞中的一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"真是令人難以忍受......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空氣還是這麼差，有種煙灰味。哈，不過總比剛才好多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“發展”和“先進”的氣味，這兩年我竟然也已經習慣了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到處都是衣著光鮮的行人和商鋪，和別的地方的繁華街也沒什麼區別，差不多也看膩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個城市的普通人都到哪去了？被整成一個音調的曲子可沒什麼欣賞價值。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是......已經走到外圍來了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊呀，這不是還有點不一樣的景色嘛。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我沒看錯的話，那是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這種情況該怎麼辦好......唔，總之先聯繫一下那些“專家”——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這樣應該就沒問題了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（......有誰，跟在後面？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（又是那些衛兵？不行，不能讓他們追上......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstrongpoint"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"好像沒有動靜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"出了城，到這裡應該就沒問題了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦？真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衛兵A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衛兵A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"找到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衛兵B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，人不在這個方向！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衛兵A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"繼續找，那些逃出來的感染者跑不遠。走，往這邊走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......好、好險......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到竟然還是被追上來了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些都是貴族的衛兵，唔，還有一點點施法的痕跡，或許還有一兩個術師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，雖然不知道您是什麼人，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛，謝謝您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舉手之勞，不用客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過現在還不是鬆一口氣的時候，那些傢伙不好甩開，他們一定還會繼續追著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的樣子，不是城裡的市民吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼緊張。唔，不過有警惕心也不是件壞事，特別是在你目前的處境之下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜......這些人已經追了你們有一段時間了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你感染有多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你怎麼知道？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不對，我不是感染者，你認錯了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你領口這裡，露出來了哦，結晶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，把這裡繫緊，這樣就沒問題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次要更小心一點哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底是什麼人，你想做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，不會突然把你抓走賣掉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我要是真想對你怎麼樣，只會比那些追著你的衛兵更輕鬆，根本不用站在這裡和你說這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（好像有道理......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"那您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你終於相信啦？語調又變得尊敬起來了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。很、很抱歉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用道歉，本來我也不算什麼需要畢恭畢敬對待的大人物，這樣反而自在些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞的貴族做派從一開始就不適合我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"您——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“你”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有可是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好、好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"您、你不是本地人嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是個薩爾貢人哦。你聽說過薩爾貢嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"薩爾貢......那是什麼樣的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是很遠，很遠的地方。也是個很自由的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡有沙漠，也有雨林，大大小小的王酋統領著自己的領地，只要能拿得出歲貢，大家就相安無事。還有一些偏僻的地方根本連地圖上都標不出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那種地方，我們自己管自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"我從沒聽說過這樣的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛到萊塔尼亞來的時候，甚至懷疑這裡和我老家不在同一片大地上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"不可思議......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很難相信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是。只是，有點難想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，沒有親自見過，可能確實會有點難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......這麼看來，不久前我好像也說了類似的話。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不得不承認，那個假惺惺的貴族跟班說的話，可能也確實有點道理。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊......怎麼又走神了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼說，這裡不算安全，衛兵很有可能還會再回來。我們先換個地方，我再給你好好說說薩爾貢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？好，好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstrongpoint"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？！你說的都是真的嗎？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"真的有從天上落下來的河流，還有比整個村子還要大的大樹？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是真的，還有看起來像山一樣高的沙地，翻過黃沙能找到巨大的洞穴，裡面埋藏著無數的財富......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個是騙你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"欸——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，別這副表情，其實也不算是騙人，這是我曾經聽過的故事，是真是假，誰也說不清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許真的有那樣鋪滿金銀珠寶的洞穴也不一定呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的有就好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，說得我都有點想家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼不回去呢？是因為太遠了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，該怎麼說呢，最開始我也沒打算久留，只是遇到了點事情，又被一個麻煩的傢伙絆住......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要是一走了之，那傢伙肯定照顧不好自己，所以只好多留一段時間幫幫對方啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"不是麻煩的人嗎？為什麼還要照顧對方......你們變成好朋友了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，算朋友嗎？好像還更複雜點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"我不太懂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，不說這個。衛兵看起來沒追到這裡，暫時應該沒什麼危險，不過保險起見，還是建議你早些離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，我可以再問一個問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"薩爾貢，也有感染者嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"果然也有嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們不會將那些病人視為洪水猛獸——至少在我老家那裡不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得病的人就只是得病而已。叢林裡的野獸也一樣會要了人的命，採果實的時候從樹上摔下去，運氣不好也頭破血流，何必這麼害怕某種疾病？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......那真好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒有那麼好。很多地方生活都很辛苦，也就是因為太辛苦了，所以才沒那麼在意這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們呢？這裡的領主一直是這樣，因為感染了，衛兵就要抓人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......原本，我們也不是這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"我的爸媽都在礦場做工，我們住離礦區最近的那條街，那裡許多人都得了病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"在礦洞裡工作的叔叔和嬸嬸們，大家最後都會得上這種病，身上長出石頭，還是得繼續幹活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"稍微有點錢的老爺都從不會踏上這條街，還健康的人，也只會想方設法地儘快搬走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來就像是隔離區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"有點像，但我聽說好的隔離區是要繳錢才能住進去的，那裡還提供麵包呢，我們這可沒有這樣的待遇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"但就算是這樣，我們也可以就這麼生活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼生活？像你父母那樣，當個礦工，這輩子不踏出你們的街區？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......這樣也不錯。有地方住，有工錢拿，這樣就很不錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"至少我曾經是這麼想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"可是礦洞塌了，爸媽沒再回來，忽然間街道就被衛兵們封住，他們開始抓街上的行人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，然後沒人敢再出門，大家待在家裡，可是那些衛兵會挨家挨戶地闖進去......我們到底做錯了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這就是所謂“妥善的處理”......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"我和其他幾個孩子，趁衛兵們不注意，從廢樓後的暗巷逃出來，我知道外面的老爺們都覺得得了病就該死，可是我不想死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......我好害怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別哭......和你一起逃出來的其他人呢？他們在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"前天我們被追趕到這附近，這裡沒有太多可以躲藏我們一群人的地方，所以大家決定分頭走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒再見到其他人，這裡現在只剩下我一個人了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"我得，我還得要去找大家才行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先別急，我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，先別說話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人停留過的痕跡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（別緊張。別去看他，慢慢呼吸......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（......呼......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好孩子。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在這裡等我。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstrongpoint"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"閣下終於打算露面了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"客人都特地回頭上門了，怎麼好意思讓你久等？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些衛兵呢，怎麼只有你一個人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡不需要他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這話聽起來真有自信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薩爾貢人，為何包庇感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼特別的理由。遇見了，就順手拉一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們又是為了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只是將感染者驅逐，根本用不到你這樣的術師親自動手，你們這兩天追捕那批礦工，又是得到了怎樣的授意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你在調查我們的動向？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說的這麼嚴肅，只是敲定合作前的例行調查罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來我還沒想到，不過今天剛剛受到了一些啟發。費爾巴哈爵士靠你們和他的衛兵粉飾了多少太平，要說出來大家一起聽聽嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼沉默嘛。我曾經見過你們施術時身邊帶著的那些奴隸，那些都是感染者吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來巫王所殘留的那些黑暗的記憶，至今也未被根除，那一類殘酷的法術，現在依然還有人在研究......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們抓感染者，是不是就是為了這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真沉悶。你不是個好的聊天對象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們並不需要太多交談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只是來見一個源石技藝的使用者一面。出於禮節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那要直接動手嗎？雖然本該儘量不惹麻煩，但我不介意領教高名在外的萊塔尼亞術師的本領。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（他們在說的那些......是什麼意思？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（奴隸......研究？那些被抓走的叔叔嬸嬸......難道都......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstrongpoint"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們無意與霍恩洛厄伯爵為敵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薩爾貢人，我聽說過你的傳聞。你的源石技藝值得一些尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我該說聲謝謝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我始終不太明白你們這些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在萊塔尼亞見到了膨脹的巨大權力，同時也見到了這裡的人們對權力的崇拜，我置身其中兩年多，但仍然沒法理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有呼吸這片土地的空氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的空氣對我來說太渾濁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼你會在這裡窒息。不合適的空氣會令人溺死其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來更像是遭遇了什麼詛咒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想要死在最奇詭的巫術下，你該去找一個血脈古老的薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"與你衝突並不在計畫之中......躲在那裡的那個感染者，可以留給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那真是太好了。剛剛我還在傷腦筋，思考要怎麼才能讓你不發出太過響亮的慘叫聲......畢竟不能影響我們之後的合作呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼。狂妄的薩爾貢人，今天的事可以不追究，但你記住......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞有自己的規矩，不因個人而改變。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總算是走了。還好沒有真的打起來，我可不想在這邊破壞點什麼，然後回去被小伯爵指著鼻子教訓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事了，可以出來了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎麼這麼安靜，又嚇到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這膽子啊......可比我妹妹小多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......才沒有嚇到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......只是你們剛剛說的那些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"被抓走的叔叔嬸嬸們，他們到底怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想聽我說謊話安慰你一下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。要聽實話的話，我只能說他們現在應該不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的貴族要讓礦洞的事故連同所有的礦工一起，全都“消失”。不管是落在那些術師手裡，還是被聽令的衛兵直接抓捕，恐怕都凶多吉少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你想知道的現狀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你先別哭，我最怕你這個年紀的小姑娘哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來你有什麼打算？和你一起逃出來的那些同伴......還要去找嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"對、對了！還不能哭，我得找到其他孩子......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"如果......如果這裡的老爺們容不下我們，我們就走！我們去別的地方，我比其他孩子都大，我是姐姐，我會保護大家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......還有叔叔嬸嬸們的仇，總有一天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離開這裡？就算是要背井離鄉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是......要拋下一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"反正，反正本來我也就沒剩下多少可以丟掉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這倒也沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，既然你有這樣的想法，那比起我，有個更可靠的人選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"更可靠的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也可以出來了，別藏了，“專家”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是，說得我像是故意躲起來一樣，就不能讓我好好登場嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，可是你的腳步聲太響，我想裝作聽不見，讓你來個帥氣登場也很難啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"分明就是你的耳朵太尖了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝誇獎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒在誇你......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"這，這位先生是......“專家”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"別聽她瞎說，不用叫得這麼正經，我只是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，你們不是感染者問題處理的“專家”嗎？我記得當初是這麼介紹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那你別忘了，你自己也是我們中的一員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......嗯。知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（太敷衍了！！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（別斤斤計較。總之情況你看到了，這女孩的事，應該可以拜託給你們吧？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（這是沒問題。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（你的身份......也確實不適合再繼續跟進下去了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哎呀，真可靠。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（少打趣我。這次你又把人家小姑娘惹哭了，你說這都幾回了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（真搞不懂，每次你都說自己不能惹事，結果這不還是一頭撞在“麻煩事”上？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哈哈，為什麼呢，想不明白啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......我也只不過按照自己的準則在做事而已。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"請問......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......還會再見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡涅利安","speakerId":"avg_426_carnli_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你還堅持自己現在的想法，我想，肯定還會再見的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"謙遜的人總說：“我屬於這裡。”\n而狂妄的人會笑：“這裡屬於我。”\n薩爾貢人的生命被孕育他們的沙土磨礪出各異的形狀，站在這裡的這一個沒有那樣狂妄，但也離謙遜相去甚遠。\n如果不被修剪規整，就無法融入異鄉，那麼就這樣吧，不必勉強——\n就坦然做個異類。\n就做你自己吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
